Phase 08 — Translation Cache

Objective

Prevent repeated translation of identical text.

Pipeline

OCR text
   ↓
Normalize
   ↓
Hash
   ↓
Cache lookup
 ┌──┴──┐
HIT   MISS
 ↓      ↓
use    Qwen
        ↓
      cache

Requirements

Create:

translation/
└── translation_cache.py

Cache key must include at minimum:

* normalized source text
* source language
* target language
* translation style
* glossary version

Hash the resulting key using SHA-256.

Storage

Use SQLite or another local persistent mechanism.

The cache must remain local.

Behavior

Identical translation requests should not call Qwen again.

Changing target language must create a different cache entry.

Changing style must create a different cache entry.

Changing glossary version must invalidate previous results.

Tests

Test:

* cache miss
* cache hit
* persistence
* different language
* different style
* different glossary version
* normalization

